    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;8.01</strong> Summary of causes and mechanisms of the production of gynaecomastia</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Foschini MP",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 456.7pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"609\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Etiology</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Age group</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mechanism of production of gynaecomastia</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Physiological</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Children and adolescents</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Hormonal imbalance in estrogens and androgens <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{28613047}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Physiological senile</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Elderly adults</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Relative increase in estrogen levels </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{14759718}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Familial increased aromatization of androgens</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Children</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Increased aromatization of androgens <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{15811932}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">X-linked disorders</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">All ages</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Full or partial androgen insensitivity syndromes </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{27087292;26609365}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Klinefelter syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A higher number of CAG repeats in <em>AR</em> leading to a reduction in its activity <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{27611179}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Carney complex</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Children</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Development of Sertoli cell tumours </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{26366315}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Peutz&ndash;Jeghers syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Children</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Loss of heterozygosity of <em>STK11</em> leading to increased aromatase expression in testicular Sertoli cells and in breast tissue <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{28560011}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Exogenous estrogens</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Adults</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Hormonal imbalance in estrogens and androgens </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{30003107}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Androgen deprivation therapy for prostate cancer</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Adults</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Unopposed estrogen activity <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{30248169}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Testicular or adrenal tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mainly adults</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Increased estrogen production </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{29193251}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Aromatase excess syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Alterations in the aromatase gene <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{24716396}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Drugs</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mainly adults</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Several mechanisms, depending on the type of drug; reviewed by Nuttall et al. </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{25827472}</span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\"> and Costanzo et al. </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{30003107}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Obesity</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Dependent on cause of obesity <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{28217517}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Alcohol-induced cirrhosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Adults</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Several mechanisms proposed, such as reduced activity of cytochrome P450 and abnormal testosterone-to-estrogen ratio </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{21484105}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Spinobulbar muscular atrophy</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">All ages</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Similar to in Klinefelter syndrome&nbsp;&ndash; an increased number of CAG repeats in <em>AR</em> <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{29464380}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Unknown</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 78.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mainly adults</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"354\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Reviewed by Costanzo et al. </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{30003107}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
